        "role": "passage_overview",
        "title": "Psa 61:1-8 . Neginah--or, Neginoth (see on Psa 4:1 , title). Separated from his usual spiritual privileges, perhaps by Absalom's rebellion, the Psalmist prays for divine aid, and, in view of past mercies, with great confidence of being heard."
